        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 0
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The extreme weather event of heavy rainfall triggered a critical system overload in reservoirs, an infrastructure problem that exposed systemic fragility. When dam operations and seasonal rains pushed the river past embankments, the result was a flooding disaster with devastating human cost, highlighting the need for paradigm shifts in infrastructure resilience.",
